ves and breathes all the exciting features this great area has on offer and is always happy to share his knowledge with everyone to ensure they make the most of what is available. If you require an agent with a proven record, a professional and personal approach and someone who will ensure you achieve your real estate dreams, contact Ray today.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Ray is a great supporter of cricket in our area and is a friend of our association.</p></br>"
